   (design 7.3; a method_<id>.j2 that needs more renders this with its own
   instructions). The method is selected by shape and its inputs are the
   scoped view under an Assignment (design 8); the model sees only those
   entities, proposes outputs of the declared kinds, and every output cites
   the input ids it rests on. A Quantity in an output is either copied from
